# `bn tat` stage timings, in milliseconds — the best of three runs of a debug build in the
# e2e sandbox (crates/bn-e2e/tests/tat_picker.rs). The lane fails when a stage exceeds
# its line × 2 (floor 120ms). Regenerate after a deliberate cost change and commit:
#   BN_E2E_TIMING_UPDATE=1 cargo test -p bn-e2e --test tat_picker -- --ignored --test-threads=1
kill	30
kill-missing	30
list	30
open-unknown	30
preview	30
preview-missing	30
rmworktree-refused	20
sublist	30
subpreview-cmd	20
subpreview-cmdsep	20
subpreview-qset	30
subpreview-window	30
subpreview-worktree	40
subtick	40
